{"id":"2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first","date":"2026-11-21","topic":"design","region":"americas","headline":"Bubble Wrap Was First Created as Wallpaper","source":{"name":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bubble_wrap"},"accent":"us","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"Two men made a new wall cover in 1957.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t1-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":3.68,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":5.77,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.56,0.88,1.02,1.2,1.5,1.82,2.16]},{"text":"They joined two simple bath covers together.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","M"],"dur":2.58,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":4.34,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.3,0.74,1.18,1.48,1.82]},{"text":"Small air pockets sat between the two thin covers.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.14,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":4.37,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.48,0.86,1.32,1.66,1.84,2.02,2.36]},{"text":"People did not buy this cover for their homes.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","V","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":2.34,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":3.82,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.36,0.54,0.8,1.04,1.28,1.56,1.66]},{"text":"A big computer company used it for boxes later.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","M","M","M"],"dur":3.32,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":5.07,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.2,0.62,1.12,1.42,1.64,1.8,2.14]}],"bands":{"core1000":86,"core1800":2,"ngsl":5,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"in 1957.","title":"Preposition of Time","note":"The preposition 'in' is used before years to show when an event happened. Here, 'in 1957' indicates the specific year the wall cover was made."},{"i":3,"focus":"did not buy","title":"Past Simple Negative","note":"We form past simple negative sentences using 'did not' followed by the base verb. In this sentence, 'did not buy' shows that people chose not to purchase the product."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 1957, Alfred Fielding and Marc Chavannes built a new wall design.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t2-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.58,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":8.07,"times":[0.0,0.2,1.7,2.02,2.64,2.84,3.04,3.84,4.02,4.3,4.52,4.82]},{"text":"They joined two bath curtains together so air stayed inside.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","S","V","M"],"dur":3.9,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":5.7,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.28,0.72,1.04,1.4,2.06,2.46,2.72,3.1]},{"text":"Homeowners did not want the product, so the idea failed quickly.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","V","O","O","M","S","S","V","M"],"dur":3.9,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":6.32,"times":[0.0,0.36,0.66,0.96,1.28,1.46,2.18,2.3,2.42,2.62,3.16]},{"text":"The men tried to sell it for plant houses, but nobody bought it.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","V","O","M","M","M","M","S","V","O"],"dur":3.48,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":5.5,"times":[0.0,0.0,0.16,0.42,0.58,0.8,0.92,1.08,1.34,2.3,2.44,2.72,3.06]},{"text":"Later, they realized the soft air pockets protected goods inside boxes.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t2-4.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","S","S","S","S","V","O","M","M"],"dur":5.18,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":6.88,"times":[0.0,0.76,0.98,1.3,1.68,1.96,2.3,2.7,3.26,3.78,4.14]},{"text":"In 1960, a large computer firm used it to move machines.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t2-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","S","S","V","O","M","M","M"],"dur":4.83,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":7.1,"times":[0.0,0.08,1.22,1.4,1.66,1.98,2.5,2.92,3.12,3.28,3.48]}],"bands":{"core1000":87,"core1800":3,"ngsl":5,"tsl":3,"nawl":0,"beyond":2},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"so air stayed inside.","title":"Conjunction of Result","note":"The conjunction 'so' links two clauses to explain a result or purpose. Here, it connects joining the curtains to the outcome of air staying trapped inside."},{"i":3,"focus":"tried to sell","title":"Verb + Infinitive Pattern","note":"The verb 'try' followed by 'to' and a base verb means to make an effort to complete an action. In this context, 'tried to sell' means they attempted to market the item."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"Two inventors named Alfred Fielding and Marc Chavannes created bubble wrap in 1957.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t3-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M"],"dur":6.89,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":7.77,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.9,1.26,1.68,2.48,2.78,3.0,3.84,4.18,4.66,5.02,5.4]},{"text":"They planned to sell the material as paper for walls that had raised patterns.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O"],"dur":4.56,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":4.69,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.34,0.6,0.82,1.0,1.36,1.76,2.04,2.4,2.76,3.2,3.32,3.6]},{"text":"The pair joined two curtains together, which trapped small air pockets inside.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t3-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","M","S","V","O","O","O","M"],"dur":4.74,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":6.22,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.22,0.56,0.96,1.3,2.38,2.46,2.72,3.18,3.58,3.94]},{"text":"Buyers did not want plastic on their walls, so the new product failed completely.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t3-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","V","O","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","V","M"],"dur":5.31,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":6.29,"times":[0.0,0.4,0.62,0.86,1.12,1.58,2.02,2.16,2.96,3.16,3.28,3.44,3.76,4.32]},{"text":"They tried selling it as greenhouse insulation, which is heat-retaining material for plant buildings.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","M","M","M","S","V","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":5.5,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":7.57,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.28,0.62,0.84,1.02,1.3,2.72,2.88,3.02,3.74,4.08,4.52,4.76]},{"text":"When that market failed, the creators discovered that the air pockets protected delicate items.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t3-5.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","S","S","V","M","S","S","S","V","O","O"],"dur":5.61,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":7.1,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.28,0.58,1.5,1.54,1.86,2.38,2.74,2.86,3.1,3.52,4.06,4.64]},{"text":"Since 1960, when IBM shipped computers with it, the product has protected packages globally.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t3-6.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","V","O","M","M","S","S","V","V","O","M"],"dur":7.02,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t3-6.m4a","durJa":8.27,"times":[0.0,0.14,1.46,1.68,2.04,2.5,2.9,3.28,3.82,3.98,4.32,4.56,4.88,5.5]}],"bands":{"core1000":76,"core1800":6,"ngsl":9,"tsl":1,"nawl":1,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":", which trapped small air pockets inside.","title":"Non-defining Relative Clause","note":"A non-defining relative clause starting with ', which' adds extra information about the action mentioned before it. Here, it explains what happened as a direct result of joining the curtains."},{"i":4,"focus":"tried selling","title":"Try + Gerund Pattern","note":"Using 'try' with an '-ing' verb means to experiment with a method to see if it works. Here, 'tried selling' means they experimented with selling the material as insulation."},{"i":6,"focus":"has protected","title":"Present Perfect Tense","note":"The present perfect tense ('has protected') shows an action that started in the past and continues to be true up to the present day. It emphasizes protection that has ongoing relevance since 1960."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 1957, Alfred Fielding and Marc Chavannes attempted to create a three-dimensional plastic wallpaper.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t4-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","S","S","S","V","V","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.99,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":9.29,"times":[0.0,0.22,1.86,2.26,2.98,3.24,3.46,4.14,4.68,5.04,5.38,5.48,6.38,6.96]},{"text":"By joining two shower curtains together, a unique sheet containing air pockets was formed.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t4-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","V"],"dur":5.61,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":6.83,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.44,0.8,1.22,1.5,2.72,2.78,3.08,3.46,3.86,4.34,4.68,4.98]},{"text":"However, homeowners rejected the unusual wall covering, forcing the creators to seek alternative uses.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t4-2.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.52,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":9.05,"times":[0.0,0.58,0.92,1.64,1.94,2.3,2.7,3.58,3.96,4.22,4.5,4.88,5.1,5.68]},{"text":"They initially marketed the sheet as greenhouse insulation, which is material that helps retain heat.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t4-3.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","O","M","M","M","S","V","C","S","V","V","O"],"dur":5.56,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":7.29,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.46,0.92,1.16,1.36,1.6,1.94,3.32,3.48,3.6,3.96,4.32,4.5,4.74]},{"text":"After that effort failed, the inventors realized the air pockets provided excellent protective cushioning.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t4-4.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","S","S","V","S","S","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":6.01,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":8.42,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.42,0.7,1.6,1.7,2.16,2.5,2.98,3.22,3.52,4.08,4.76,5.18]},{"text":"In 1960, the Sealed Air Corporation was established to sell the wrapping material to industrial clients.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t4-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.66,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":8.83,"times":[0.0,0.06,1.34,1.48,1.86,2.08,2.4,2.94,3.44,3.84,4.06,4.28,4.46,4.96,5.34,5.68]},{"text":"That same year, IBM began using the soft material to safely transport its 1401 computers.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t4-6.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","V","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.49,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":8.4,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.36,1.02,1.32,1.94,2.34,2.56,2.7,3.06,3.56,3.84,4.48,4.8,5.58]},{"text":"Today, bubble wrap is widely recognized as an essential shipping material and stress reliever.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t4-7.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","V","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":6.21,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t4-7.m4a","durJa":7.28,"times":[0.0,0.68,0.98,1.28,1.52,1.86,2.42,2.9,3.02,3.26,3.76,4.4,4.76,5.1]}],"bands":{"core1000":63,"core1800":13,"ngsl":9,"tsl":6,"nawl":2,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"was formed.","title":"Passive Voice","note":"Passive voice ('was' + past participle) places attention on the object being created rather than who made it. Here, 'was formed' highlights the resulting plastic sheet."},{"i":2,"focus":", forcing the creators to seek alternative uses.","title":"Participle Clause for Result","note":"An '-ing' participle phrase added at the end of a main clause introduces an immediate consequence. Here, 'forcing...' describes the direct result of homeowners rejecting the wall covering."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"When inventors Alfred Fielding and Marc Chavannes joined two shower curtains together in 1957, packaging was not their original goal.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","S","V","V","C","C","C"],"dur":9.11,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":13.86,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.86,1.2,1.9,2.2,2.42,3.14,3.44,3.78,4.18,4.48,4.96,5.26,6.72,7.08,7.48,7.88,8.16,8.5]},{"text":"Instead, the pair intended to sell the resulting sheet of trapped air pockets as a novel, three-dimensional plastic wallpaper.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t5-1.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","V","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.68,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":10.23,"times":[0.0,0.72,0.8,1.0,1.38,1.66,1.9,2.14,2.6,2.9,3.12,3.34,3.76,4.1,4.76,4.86,5.24,6.22,6.72]},{"text":"After homeowners rejected the unconventional interior decoration, the creators attempted to sell the product as greenhouse insulation to trap heat.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t5-2.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","O","O","O","O","S","S","V","V","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.13,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":12.04,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.48,1.2,1.6,1.94,2.66,3.8,3.9,4.16,4.64,4.88,5.1,5.3,5.56,5.88,6.18,6.88,7.38,7.56]},{"text":"That venture also failed, prompting the inventors to realize that the air-filled plastic offered exceptional shock absorption for delicate items.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t5-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","M","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":8.55,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":11.97,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.48,0.86,2.12,2.12,2.32,2.74,2.9,3.16,3.6,3.79,4.32,4.8,5.54,6.06,6.68,7.04,7.52,7.76]},{"text":"In 1960, Fielding co-founded Sealed Air Corporation, a company built around manufacturing and distributing their newly repurposed protective material.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t5-4.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":9.38,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":12.7,"times":[0.0,0.08,1.24,1.71,2.28,2.78,3.0,4.08,4.24,4.48,4.8,5.08,5.82,6.24,6.74,7.08,7.32,8.22,8.54]},{"text":"The product achieved its first major success later that year when IBM adopted it to safeguard delicate 1401 computers during transit.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t5-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.28,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":10.89,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.34,0.6,0.96,1.26,1.56,2.0,2.5,2.72,2.98,3.48,3.74,4.38,4.58,4.76,5.08,5.56,6.6,7.16,7.66]},{"text":"Although \"Bubble Wrap\" remains a registered trademark of Sealed Air, the term has effectively become a general descriptor for cushioned packaging.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t5-6.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","S","S","V","V","V","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":7.17,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t5-6.m4a","durJa":9.6,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.54,0.84,1.26,1.46,1.72,2.12,2.48,2.78,3.46,3.58,3.76,3.96,4.42,4.8,5.02,5.34,5.76,6.22,6.58]},{"text":"Decades later, the humble plastic sheet has evolved from a failed wall cover into a global shipping staple and pop-culture icon.","voice":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/t5-7.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.14,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-21-design-bubble-wrap-was-first/ja/t5-7.m4a","durJa":10.87,"times":[0.0,0.5,1.08,1.26,1.52,1.94,2.36,2.58,2.92,3.26,3.32,3.64,3.98,4.3,4.78,4.96,5.26,5.7,6.22,6.45,7.12]}],"bands":{"core1000":60,"core1800":11,"ngsl":11,"tsl":7,"nawl":2,"beyond":9},"grammar":[{"i":6,"focus":"Although \"Bubble Wrap\" remains a registered trademark of Sealed Air,","title":"Clause of Concession","note":"The subordinating conjunction 'Although' introduces a clause expressing contrast or concession. Here, it contrasts the official trademark status with how the term is used in everyday language."},{"i":7,"focus":"has evolved","title":"Present Perfect for Transformation","note":"The present perfect tense ('has evolved') is used to express a long-term transition leading up to the present moment. It connects the product's origin as a wall cover to its current global status."}]}},"glossary":[{"word":"insulation","lemma":"insulation","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˌɪnsəˈleɪʃən/","definition":"material used to prevent heat or sound from passing through","tiers":["t3","t4","t5"]},{"word":"cushioning","lemma":"cushioning","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˈkʊʃənɪŋ/","definition":"soft material that protects objects from damage or impact","tiers":["t4"]},{"word":"repurposed","lemma":"repurpose","pos":"verb","ipa":"/ˌriːˈpɜːrpəst/","definition":"adapted for use in a different way or pu